  (text "Draft B: the FC reads the GNSS over DDC (I2C, address 0x42) on the Qwiic bus.\nUART (TXD/RXD) only on test pads TP4/TP5: u-center / firmware update with a USB-UART.\nEXTINT not used. RESET_N: no capacitor (u-blox).\nTIMEPULSE shares the pin with the SAFEBOOT strap: only a MOSFET gate on it."
